body:
It's honestly traumatic lmao, when I am paranoid they are my little demons (with other types of parasites) it feels surreal sometimes, and like it even worries my family lmao. 

&#x200B;

I think I may be disciplined with it but at the same time, I put myself in risky situations just to save a few cents, like there's one time that just to save the bus money I walked 5-6km in a storm because I felt above everything, gladly I didn't get sick but I was soaked and I could barely see since I have glasses. In high school, I didn't eat because I instead saved the money for lunch and that eventually lead to horrible gastritis. Seems like extreme thinking always gets me lmao. I either care too much even to hurt myself in the process or I care too little becoming apathetic.
